    <item>
      <title>Codex Bar 1.9.0</title>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div style="white-space: pre-wrap"&gt;- Check for compatible updates quietly at launch and once a day, without automatic update pop-ups.
- Highlight available updates in the context menu and show the version; selecting it opens Sparkle&amp;#x27;s update window.
- Show a small red dot in the menu bar when an update to a new major version is available.
- Keep the last known update visible if a later check fails.&lt;/div&gt;</description>
      <sparkle:version>1.9.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.9.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 02:19:39 +0000</pubDate>
