    <item>
      <title>Codex Bar 1.8.0</title>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div style="white-space: pre-wrap"&gt;- Add a horizontal macOS desktop widget that displays the five-hour and weekly limits using the selected panel theme. Desktop widgets require macOS 14 or later; macOS controls their refresh timing.
- Add a movable Picture-in-Picture window with the same themes and live limits, available from the menu bar context menu. Its position and visibility are saved.
- Keep the latest widget snapshot in a local shared container and show previous data when a refresh fails.&lt;/div&gt;</description>
      <sparkle:version>1.8.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.8.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 01:02:17 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/frankydzoro/codex-bar/releases/download/v1.8.0/CodexBar-1.8.0-macOS-Apple-Silicon.zip" sparkle:edSignature="ve0GBH3PQKtkPnuiaLO3UQ9VmgcXBSAlEDHTaOYtB1wSDLJownrIdDu63xviTR8P+ZyiTX07FUCCQ8K73AgUDg==" length="1409043" type="application/octet-stream" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Codex Bar 1.7.4</title>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div style="white-space: pre-wrap"&gt;- Keep the limits panel visible when Settings is open, including when clicking outside or switching apps.
- Continue to allow closing the panel using the menu bar icon or Escape.&lt;/div&gt;</description>
